{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_118_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_118","textTraditional":"一、四年，春，王正月，公及齊侯平莒及郯，莒人不肯。公伐莒，取向。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_118_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_118","textTraditional":"及者，內為志焉爾。平，成也。不肯者，可以肯也。伐猶可，取向甚矣。莒人辭不受治也。伐莒，義兵也。取向，非也，乘義而為利也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_118_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_118","textTraditional":"二、秦伯稻卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_118_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_118","textTraditional":"三、夏，六月，乙酉，鄭公子歸生弒其君夷。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_118_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_118","textTraditional":"四、赤狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_118_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_118","textTraditional":"五、秋，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_118_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_118","textTraditional":"六、公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_118_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_118","textTraditional":"七、冬，楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}